, the United Kingdom and other European markets. Contact the team for current availability in your country."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can European retailers and distributors partner with TAVAAZO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Retailers, wholesalers, distributors and HORECA suppliers can use the Partner with us form to request product information, documents and a market-specific B2B quotation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does TAVAAZO offer Pakistani biryani and curry spice mixes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The range includes Biryani Masala, Bombay Biryani, Sindhi Biryani, Mutton Biryani, Yakhni Pulao, Qorma, Nihari, Paya, Haleem and other Pakistani cooking blends."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I download the TAVAAZO catalogue?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The complete 2026 TAVAAZO product catalogue can be opened or downloaded from the Catalogue links on the website."}}]}]}0:{"P":null,"c":["","recipes"],"q":"","i":false,"f":[[["",{"children":["recipes",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",16],[["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/1d8ed50033788748.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined","nonce":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en-GB","children":["$","body",null,{"className":"antialiased","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$L3","$L4"]}]}]]}],{"children":["$L5",{"children":["$L6",{},null,false,null]},null,false,"$@7"]},null,false,null],"$L8",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$9",[]],"S":true,"h":null,"s":"$undefined","l":"$undefined","p":"$undefined","d":"$undefined","b":"ahWAvfhQ6qI7dE9k4Fg4M"}
